# RBI Guidance Note on Operational Risk Management and Operational Resilience (2024) — Impact on NBFCs

**Analysed via:** Subhojit Shome & Archisman Bhattacharjee, Vinod Kothari Consultants, "Risk Management Function of NBFCs - A Need to Integrate Operational Risk Management & Resilience: An examination of the RBI Guidance Note on Operational Risk Management and Resilience" (9 May 2024)
